# Moderation safety

- Resolve administrator and protected-user status before recommending or executing a ban.
- Administrators and protected users must never be banned, including through owner callbacks or retries.
- Treat an unknown actor or uncertain classification as a review case, not automatic guilt.
- Re-authorize the actor and re-check target protection immediately before every side effect.
- Keep AI classification advisory; deterministic application code owns authorization and actions.
- Make Telegram update handling and moderation callbacks idempotent and auditable.
